msgid ""
"'Product Created' triggers before a product is fully saved, often missing "
"key data. By contrast, 'Product Updated' fires once the product is complete."
" If a new product is detected, it is created; otherwise, it is updated. This"
" approach processes only fully created and published products, avoiding "
"issues caused by incomplete information."
msgstr ""

